"metamerism-rgb-subpixels":{"description":{"zh":"眼睛只量三种视锥的三个数，红绿子像素一起亮就能和黄光一样；纯光谱色落在三原色色域之外。","en":"The eye reports only three cone signals, so red plus green sub-pixels match yellow light; pure spectral colours lie outside the RGB gamut."},"source":"../tech/devices/inside-a-phone/#screen","lessons":[{"slug":"inside-a-phone","step":null,"anchor":"screen","category":"tech","stage":"senior","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["为什么红加绿是黄","三原色原理","屏幕的黄色","视锥细胞","色域","光的混合和颜料的混合","屏幕只有三种颜色","三原色能混出所有颜色","屏幕怎么显示颜色","屏幕显示颜色","像素"],"en":["why red and green make yellow","RGB colour mixing","cone cells","colour gamut","additive vs subtractive colour","screens use only three colours","three colors","how do screens show color","pixels","pixel","RGB"]}},
